# Optional — enables server-side AI photo verification (/api/verify-pothole).
# Without this set, the app still works fully; it just skips the AI tier
# and relies on client-side photo quality heuristics only.
#
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# In Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add GEMINI_API_KEY
#
# NEVER put your real key in this file — it's committed to git. Put it in
# a local .env (already gitignored) for local testing, and in Vercel's
# Environment Variables UI for production. See README.md → "AI photo
# verification" for the full setup steps.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
